  "name": "luh-motion-planning-using-reactive-circular-fields-simulations",
  "notes": "In this repository, we provide the video files that show the simulations of the paper: \"Motion Planning using Reactive Circular Fields: A 2D Analysis of Collision Avoidance and Goal Convergence\". Each scenario is represented by one exemplary video for each planner. We also added a video showing a very coarse discretization for the prediction of our ICF planner in the 3D environment. The videos can be downloaded together as a zip. file or viewed in your browser.\r\nAdditionally, we provide all parameters that were used in the simulations, including recommendations for the choice of relevant parameters of the CFP planner and the proof of the auxiliary Lemma 7.",
